# Real Firebase config -- never commit these. Only the placeholder template
# (android/app/google-services.json.example) is tracked. Keep the real file
# either as android/app/google-services.json (untracked, thanks to the line
# below) or, for build14.bat's workflow, as google-services-real.json next to
# the script -- either way it must never be `git add`-ed.
android/app/google-services.json
google-services-real.json
